flowchart TD

    A([Start smtpCallback])

    A --> B[Print SMTP Status Information]

    B --> C{Email Send Successful?}

    C -->|No| D([Return])

    C -->|Yes| E[Print Message Summary Header]

    E --> F[Print Completed Message Count]

    F --> G[Print Failed Message Count]

    G --> H[Print Summary Footer]

    H --> I[Initialize Result Loop<br/>i = 0]

    I --> J{i < smtp.sendingResult.size?}

    J -->|No| K[Print Final Separator]

    J -->|Yes| L[Get SMTP_Result Item]

    L --> M[Print Message Number]

    M --> N{Result Completed?}

    N -->|Yes| O[Print Status = success]

    N -->|No| P[Print Status = failed]

    O --> Q[Print Date and Time]
    P --> Q

    Q --> R[Print Recipient]

    R --> S[Print Subject]

    S --> T[Increment i]

    T --> J

    K --> U[Clear smtp.sendingResult]

    U --> V([End smtpCallback])
